flowchart TB
  accTitle: How the visual check and the screenshot bot render the images in groups
  accDescr: Each language renders in four groups at once, each group on a runner of its own. For a pull request, each job of a group of the visual check first looks for an earlier run of the visual check, on a branch of this repository, that rendered the same files; it takes the images of that run in under a minute. Otherwise, and in every run of the screenshot bot, each group renders from a fresh demo. The cards and the first games make group 1, more games with the quick start group 2, the players with their own matches and the dartboard without Autodarts group 3, the corrections of a dart, the formats, the big tournaments and the calendar group 4. The visual check puts the four groups of each language together, compares them with the committed images and writes the comparison into one comment on the pull request. The screenshot bot renders each group of each language as a shard, beside the recording of the live demo, and once every shard rendered, it keeps one pull request with every picture that changed.

  START["A pull request or a push to main<br/>changes the integration, a blueprint or the screenshot tool"]
  START -->|"pull request"| KEY
  START -->|"push to main, release,<br/>every Thursday"| RENDER
  KEY["Visual check, each job of a group:<br/>did an earlier run of this repository<br/>render the same files?"]
  KEY -->|"yes"| TAKE["It takes the images of that run,<br/>in under a minute"]
  KEY -->|"no, or on demand"| RENDER["One runner for each group,<br/>each with a fresh demo"]
  RENDER --> G1 & G2 & G3 & G4
  G1["Group 1:<br/>the cards, the live card,<br/>the first games, about 8 min"]
  G2["Group 2:<br/>more games, the quick start,<br/>about 8 min"]
  G3["Group 3:<br/>the players with their own matches,<br/>the manual board, about 7 min"]
  G4["Group 4:<br/>the corrections, the formats,<br/>the big tournaments up to their pictures,<br/>the calendar, about 7 min"]
  TAKE & G1 & G2 & G3 & G4 --> COLLECT["Visual check: one job per language<br/>puts its groups together and compares<br/>them with the committed images"]
  COLLECT --> COMMENT["One comment<br/>on the pull request"]
  G1 & G2 & G3 & G4 --> BOT["Screenshot bot: every shard,<br/>with the recording of the live demo,<br/>in one pull request of what changed"]

  classDef bot fill:#526cfe2e,stroke:#526cfe,stroke-width:2px
  classDef done fill:#16a34a2e,stroke:#16a34a,stroke-width:2px
  class KEY,RENDER,G1,G2,G3,G4,COLLECT bot
  class TAKE,COMMENT,BOT done
